cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use b.yoihen, please cite the dataset and identify the actual
  release version, artifact digest, and the role it played in your work.
type: dataset
title: "b.yoihen: Alive DVD — Computer-Use Memory / MAP Representation"
version: "V25 500002 BEYOND"
authors:
  - family-names: Sougaijam
    given-names: Yoihenba
abstract: >-
  A line-oriented computer-use memory / MAP representation developed
  through an iPhone a-Shell workflow in Imphal, Manipur. The DATA ONLY
  release represents vision values, DOM context, action descriptions,
  and recorded explanations. Historical V21–V25 JSON reports describe
  collection, expert routing, code/self-healing, and self-update-oriented
  content. Project claims and independently reproduced capabilities
  must be distinguished. This artifact is data, not model weights.
keywords:
  - computer-use
  - datasets
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - tool-use
  - self-update research
  - provenance
  - AI governance
